==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 3.33~16.67 seconds<sup>100f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[LeMurr]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.

==Strategy==
All [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] are practically required here as without them, the Aliens, particularly Gorriliam and LeMurr will be buffed to oblivion. With them, this stage becomes fairly easy, only requiring a few [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark cats]] such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], as well as some [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien cats]] like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]].

